</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/23047fba-7113-11f0-98fe-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2025-07-22T125338Z-28348862-RC2MZEAHR1T4-RTRMADP-3-UN-CLIMATE-AI.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/23047fba-7113-11f0-98fe-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2025-07-22T125338Z-28348862-RC2MZEAHR1T4-RTRMADP-3-UN-CLIMATE-AI.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">ffb31e66-7979-11f1-9bc4-75ad97518408</guid><pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 20:34:00 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/23047fba-7113-11f0-98fe-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2025-07-22T125338Z-28348862-RC2MZEAHR1T4-RTRMADP-3-UN-CLIMATE-AI.jpg">© Manon Cruz / Reuters</source><dc:creator>法广</dc:creator></item><item><category>国际</category><title>面对“种族歧视”    马克龙鼎力支持姆巴佩</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85/20260706-%E9%9D%A2%E5%AF%B9-%E7%A7%8D%E6%97%8F%E6%AD%A7%E8%A7%86-%E9%A9%AC%E5%85%8B%E9%BE%99%E9%BC%8E%E5%8A%9B%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%A7%86%E5%B7%B4%E4%BD%A9</link><description>
